WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.546
A useful architecture rule is to promote stable
meaning into persistent objects If

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:13.028
many consumers agree on what a patient-admission row
means that can become a view If

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:19.558
one report uses a temporary thirty-day threshold
keep that logic in the report If

00:00:19.571 --> 00:00:26.340
a summary is expensive and reused frequently
materialization may be appropriate Do

00:00:26.354 --> 00:00:29.051
not turn every query into a database object
